;    1: TDecorate(count=1099, unk2=16757864, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    2: TDecorate(count=101, unk2=255, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    3: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=しゅうえん, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    4: TDecorate(count=1343, unk2=8388863, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    5: TDecorate(count=329, unk2=6413008, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    6: TDecorate(count=56, unk2=65535, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    7: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=はんすう, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    8: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=うの, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    9: TDecorate(count=12, unk2=5265653, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   10: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=・・, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   11: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=てい, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   12: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=だま, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   13: TDecorate(count=4, unk2=11271932, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   14: TDecorate(count=6, unk2=16755455, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=5817, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=5311, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\廃屋天井.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Between 7 and 8 p.m.―probably about that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The sun had set completely, and my second night in this abandoned hut was beginning.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
By now the Motoki-cho group must have reached the Arata settlement and seen my memo.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It should be safe to come out of here by now.<PG>
I was hungry, as you'd expect, but this was no time for a leisurely meal.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A person can live about a week without eating.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
On my way back to the settlement, I mean to at least drink some water from the stream and quench my thirst, but―<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Haha... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Hahaha... it's hopeless after all...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Better the easy way... than suffering...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　People all die sometime anyway..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My negativity act is finally reaching its grand finale.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After blurting out negative things since morning, my own thoughts are about to roll that way too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The power of words out of your own mouth is frightening.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even without meaning it, I could end up doing as I say.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I slowly got up, took out my earplugs―
{PAUSE ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\door_old1.ogg" "SE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
and put my hand on the door.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\登山廃屋.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
In contrast to my heart, it was very quiet outside.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Trees in fresh bud swayed with a soft rustling, and for the first time in a long while my hearing was stirred.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'll tell everyone else too... it's better to die without suffering, after all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\砂利を歩く.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I staggered off toward the mountain stream.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Walking while pretending to be in a daze isn't easy either.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\dressing.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"............?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After I'd walked a few dozen meters, the ground underfoot suddenly turned to mud.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Had there been a passing shower?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
However well my ears were stopped, I'd have noticed rain this heavy beating down on the hut.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The hut, it seemed, had only just escaped the downpour.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\深淵からの呼び声.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\登山土砂崩れ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"What is this... I have to go tell everyone, and now..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The road toward the settlement was blocked by a landslide.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Climbing over it would be easy, but even if I knocked out the whole Motoki-cho group, carrying them to the hut would be impossible.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll have to think of somewhere else...<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hurry... I have to hurry..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My first rock climbing in a long time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With the hunger on top of it, I couldn't muster much strength, and the climb didn't go smoothly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No doubt <STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> is already aware of what I'm doing right now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But there was no sign of that eerie sound ringing out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It may have rung a few times while I had my ears stopped, but at least I haven't heard the sound once today.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\渓流.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\渓流夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―The water of the stream was a little cloudy, maybe from the rain.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I wanted to gulp it down, but for now I made do with rinsing my mouth.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I looked at my arm, the cut had already scabbed over.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The wound seemed to have closed, but not completely.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I put too much strength into it, it would probably bleed again.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\アポカリプティック2.ogg" "SE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
That sound...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The apocalyptic sound―the sound that announces the <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="しゅうえん">end</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When this sound rings, a corpse comes close by...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Without thinking, I nearly drew my knife, but stopped my hand just in time.<PG>
Right now, I must not be <STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>'s enemy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I have given up resisting―that is the line.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Don't oppose them; show them I'm not an enemy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\風呂飛込み.ogg" "VOICE2" "NORMAL" "800" "0"}
Once, I plunged my face into the stream.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Water in early April is truly cold.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\風呂潜る.ogg" "VOICE2" "NORMAL" "800" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hah... hah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Before I ran out of breath, the cold was too much to bear, and I lifted my face out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "3000" "PASS"}
But I felt a gaze that made me forget even that cold at once.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Someone... 
{PAUSE ""}
Someone is watching me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That sound rang out, which means...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Ghost.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\サクラ白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Found you at last. What are you doing in a place like this?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Had she been watching me all along?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Making no move to run, and no show of fighting―
{PAUSE ""}
I looked steadily into <STYLE ID="4">Mom's</STYLE> eyes.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... What about </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Uncle</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"As you can see, it's just me. So don't worry."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As if I could feel safe!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd like to go on a war footing here, but I mustn't show any will to resist.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm going to negotiate―to become one of <STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>'s own.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, I..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, I know you have a lot to say, but hurry and run from here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh?"</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Right now, neither </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> nor </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> is watching. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> run, quickly, and live!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Listen, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">. </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> is with </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> right now, regenerating his body. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">We're dead, so we need </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> to repair our bodies regularly. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Right now she can't sense-steal me, so she won't notice!"</STYLE><PG>
I was taken aback as <STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE> suddenly rattled all this off at me.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... But </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, yesterday you..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"I'm sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">We've had hostages taken by </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... Hostages...?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "bittersweet.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\集落全景夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"If we defy </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, the people of this settlement will be wiped out at once. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, you've seen </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'s power for yourself, haven't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... But doing that would leave </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> unable to reproduce too, wouldn't it...?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\荒田枯れ木.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> can parasitize other animals, not just humans. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">She gives humans priority simply because she can take in their intelligence, that's all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... But me, abandoning everyone and running away..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'re the only one who can get away now. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">There's no time to go to the settlement and get everyone out. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">So... at least </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\渓流夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\サクラ白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"I'm sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">We finally meet again after 10 years, and it has to be like this..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Meeting a dead person is, to begin with, impossible.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Whatever the form, I got to see <STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So I don't want <STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE> to apologize to me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE>... you've been suffering all this time, haven't you...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\キーン.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\スカイツリー行列思い出.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "14" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\z50.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="6">"'Doubting everything' means asking 'is that really so?' and 'why is that so?'―doubting, and digging deeper."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\キーン.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\渓流夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\サクラ白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "14" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Time and again, I've <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="はんすう">mulled over</STYLE> <STYLE ID="6">Goto-chan's</STYLE> advice.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I know―what is happening now is impossible.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So it's dangerous to swallow whole anything that stems from it.<PG>
That means it's dangerous to <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="うの">take</STYLE> what that book says at face value, and dangerous to believe what I see and hear.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So even <STYLE ID="4">Mom's</STYLE> sweet words―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Repeat the 'why'...!<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... But </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, why haven't you let anyone escape before now?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　The last time </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Uncle</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was having his body repaired, you could have let everyone escape like this, couldn't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"That would throw the settlement into an uproar. 'The dead are walking.'"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... Then why didn't you at least tell </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　If you'd told just </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, he could have spoken for you to everyone."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"That's dangerous. In this settlement, danger sense is already shunned as 'the witch's power.'"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... Then...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Then..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I couldn't think of any more questions.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Mom's</STYLE> answers are perfectly reasonable, and they hold together.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then maybe it's all right for me to just run...<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">... whatever happens, stay alive. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Go back toward Toyotake and down the mountain path, and you'll be safe."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Toward Toyotake―that's the direction the hut was in.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
